WEBVTT

00:00:00.796 --> 00:00:02.796
Thank you for watching!

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.128
I don't know

00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:34.756
Don't forget, UA

00:00:36.364 --> 00:00:38.364
Thank you for watching!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.890
Kin-Kin-Chan, it's Christmas Eve today!

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:37.640
Huh? What's that, Do-Kin-Chan?

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.140
Don't tell me you're the only one who wants to get a present?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.360
It has nothing to do with it, right?

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:50.730
Ta-da! Unfortunately, you don't get a present, you take it away!

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.480
Santa Claus, what's Christmas?

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.500
Mmm, I'm going to burn!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.740
This year, I'm going to make everyone who's looking forward to Christmas go crazy!

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.240
Let's go, Shin-chan!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:04.410
It's no use. I'll take care of you.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:05.890
All right, let's go!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:29.770
Oh, no, no, no.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.060
Hehehehe

00:02:32.108 --> 00:02:34.728
All right, I'm ready.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.860
Ah...

00:02:36.268 --> 00:02:38.268
My back hurts.

00:02:38.268 --> 00:02:40.468
Mr. Santa, are you okay?

00:02:40.588 --> 00:02:42.228
It's okay, it's okay.

00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:45.928
The kids are all looking forward to the presents.

00:02:45.928 --> 00:02:47.628
You have to do your best tonight.

00:02:47.628 --> 00:02:49.028
I'm counting on you.

00:02:50.668 --> 00:02:51.168
Oh yeah?

00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:57.424
Who could it be?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.670
I was wondering what to do if I didn't meet Santa.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:06.750
Who are you?

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.800
Nice to meet you.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.490
I'm a candle man, Hono.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:11.690
Hono-kun.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.500
What do you want to do on Christmas Eve?

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.560
It's Christmas.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.180
Santa, look at this.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.540
What's this?

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:25.370
Our village is a small port in the mountains.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.790
So Santa always passes by without noticing.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:28.930
I'm going to sleep.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.640
I'm really worried about my friends.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.350
Everyone is looking forward to Santa Claus coming.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.620
So please make sure you don't forget to come.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.730
Yeah, yeah. I got it.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:40.970
I'll definitely give you a present.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.100
Thank you.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.180
The lighthouse is the landmark.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:47.520
That's right.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.620
To make it easier to understand,

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:49.500
I'll put a lot of lights on the tree in the village square.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.760
Oh, that's a good idea.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.550
I'll get ready right away.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:56.850
I'm waiting for you to be careful.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.370
Ahaha, you're a lively candle man.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.730
Well then, I'll prepare more presents for my new friend.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:14.940
It's a quiet Christmas Eve.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.080
I think I should go home and help Batako-san.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.000
What?

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.070
That was close. It's all good now.

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:34.410
Thank you, mom.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:37.300
Everyone, what's wrong?

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:42.130
We were the only ones who could turn on the light when you weren't there.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.930
All we had to do was turn on the light.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.480
Thank you, everyone.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:48.800
What a wonderful tree.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.200
The light is so bright.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.360
Mr. Mayor, this will look good on Santa.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.120
Yes.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.600
He won't forget this small village.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.700
I wonder if Santa will come for sure.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.400
Will you bring me a present?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.110
Yeah, I made a promise to Santa.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:10.850
Yay!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.980
Let's go home now.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.780
If you don't make a good boy, Santa will be disappointed.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:17.860
Yes!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:22.320
Thanks to you, it will be a good Christmas, Hana.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:22.980
Yes!

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.340
Before the light came on, I decorated this tree with a candle.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:37.050
The swaying light was as beautiful as a dream.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:55.510
But the light is brighter and more beautiful.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.050
Candles like me are too old-fashioned.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.670
That's not true! The gentle light of the candle is also very wonderful!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.690
Look! Look at that!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.220
It's a windmill, right?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:08.720
Yeah.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.320
That's how you turn on the lights.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:15.200
When the first light in the village was turned on, everyone was very happy that it became convenient.

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:19.210
That's how the candle man's job disappeared, too.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.690
Oh, is that so?

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:25.990
But this year, Santa will bring a present for you!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.780
When I heard that...

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.320
But what are you going to do?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.350
I'm going to take all your presents here in this village.

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:37.310
All the presents?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.450
All right, let's start the Christmas party.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.420
I'm going to introduce you to my friends.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.680
Bambam, my friends are over there.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:51.300
What?

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.560
It's a beautiful Christmas tree, isn't it?

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:03.280
I can see it clearly from here, too.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:05.290
Anpanman helped me, too.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.450
Let me introduce you.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.950
Mr. Akari from Todai.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:08.810
Nice to meet you.

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.450
Thanks to Mr. Akari and the Todai,

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.410
I won't get lost on the road.

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:16.590
I also want to be of help to everyone like Mr. Akari someday.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.870
Ono-kun is doing his best for everyone, isn't he?

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:21.330
Besides,

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.400
I feel very calm when I see your light.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:26.400
Oh, me too.

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.360
That's right.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:29.980
Thank you for watching.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.880
I asked Anpanman to take a look at the place of work.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.300
The place of work?

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:34.060
Yes.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:45.540
The camp...

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.070
Yes, I made it.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.570
That's amazing.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.430
Only Akari and Anpanman showed this.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:54.990
It's a waste.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:56.610
We should have shown it to everyone.

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.250
I'm sure Jam Prince and the others want to see it too.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:03.440
Akari-san started working!

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:04.860
Wow!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:27.690
Even though it's Christmas Eve?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:36.720
It's strange. The village is darker.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.110
It's true. What's wrong?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:44.200
Oh, it's off. If I can't see the Christmas tree, I can't get Santa to come.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.170
It's hard. I'll go.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.480
It's Akari.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:50.850
Akari.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.350
It's okay.

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.020
Light up the village.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:56.980
What's that?

00:08:58.920 --> 00:08:59.640
It's hard.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.100
Super Octopus, the Christmas robot that destroys everything!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.530
I won't let you get in the way of a happy Christmas!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:17.340
Why does he always show up at the right time?

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.850
My voice is like a Viking!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.740
Don't get in the way!

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:27.030
You'll freeze to death in snow!

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:36.110
I have to go to the bakery because it's dirty and I don't have the strength.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.640
I can't do it. I can't light it with black ice.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:05.180
Okay, I'll melt this ice.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:15.860
It's a new face.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.390
Uncle

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.540
It's all clean now.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.260
Uncle, I brought a cleaning man.

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.020
Long time no see.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.140
Thank you for your hard work.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.860
Leave it to me.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.740
No matter if it's snow or ice, there is nothing that can't clean this cleaning board.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:36.810
Anpanman, we don't have time. Let's hurry.

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:39.040
Shut up!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:56.280
It's supposed to be around here. Can you see anything?

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.890
No, it's pitch black and nothing.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.880
But there's only one small light.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.660
I can't see the tree with a lot of light.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.910
I'm useless after all.

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:55.740
I'm getting better.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:56.820
Cheer up.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.020
It's almost time.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.360
Your cheeks are getting warmer.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:04.260
I'm sorry, Akari-san. After all, I'm not good at sending the time.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:11.280
Hono-kun, have more confidence. If you shine from the inside of your heart, you will become a really bright light.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.540
That's right. I've become weak.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.680
If you really shine, even if it's too late!

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:24.790
Pan-man, are you still there?

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.600
A little more. Hono-kun should be shining at the lighthouse.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.740
Be careful not to miss it!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.030
Leave it to me, the cleaning man!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.010
Thank you!

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.870
Ah, it's so hard to go to Anpanman!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.700
I didn't notice and just passed by!

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.380
Alright! I'll go pick up Santa!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.650
Leave this place to me and the cleaning man!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.140
Then I'll go to the village!

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.590
Ah! Please take me with you!

00:13:24.230 --> 00:13:24.750
Okay!

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.740
I'm in trouble. I can't see the light.

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:35.060
The last gift from the candle man's village.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.640
Santa, over there!

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:42.170
What? There it is.

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:44.930
It's a lighthouse. There should be a village nearby.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:45.750
Let's get off.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.140
Something's wrong.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:53.660
What?

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.130
What are you doing?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:04.780
Baikinman!

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.490
You're going to eat it, right?

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.040
I'm going to eat it all.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.160
I can't.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.240
This is for the children who are looking forward to Christmas.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.860
And Baikinman and

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:14.920
Dakin-chan

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.420
Christmas present

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:22.830
Baikinman

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:25.510
Even if you tell me to stop,

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.950
Bye-bye!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:34.610
We have to be too close

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:38.230
****

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:21.070
This time, it's my turn!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.420
Help us this year, too.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.420
Are you okay?

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:03.020
I'm okay.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.580
Hurry up and go to Hono's village.

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.430
Yes, sir.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:24.510
I'm almost there.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.760
Thank you.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:27.530
I'm back.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.590
Leave it to me.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.090
Cleaning! Cleaning!

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:31.750
Look!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.890
The foundation is back to its original state!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:38.610
Look!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:51.030
What a gentle shine!

00:17:00.828 --> 00:17:05.828
This is the first time I've ever seen such a wonderful and warm Christmas tree.

00:17:05.828 --> 00:17:07.088
It's Hono-kun!

00:17:07.104 --> 00:17:09.204
It's a candle that Hono-kun made.

00:17:09.204 --> 00:17:09.884
Yeah.

00:17:09.948 --> 00:17:11.708
I brought it from home.

00:17:11.708 --> 00:17:13.148
It's so beautiful.

00:17:13.148 --> 00:17:15.188
It's like I'm in a dream.

00:17:15.612 --> 00:17:17.372
Oh, no! The night is breaking!

00:17:17.372 --> 00:17:20.212
If I don't hurry, I won't have time to give you a present!

00:17:20.764 --> 00:17:22.424
Let's help them out too!

00:17:22.424 --> 00:17:23.564
Thank you!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:44.620
The candle is also a present, so there is no problem with the light.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.320
Oh, that's right. The electricity will be fixed soon.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.950
It means that Hono-kun's candle is useful.

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.160
Let's do our best in a little while.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.800
Thank you for your hard work.

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.190
Shokupanman, didn't you see Hono-kun?

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:08.510
No.

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:09.790
When I saw him at the end,

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.350
I put a candle on this tree

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.050
and gave it to him.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:22.970
It's all thanks to you.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:29.570
Hey,

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:29.970
I'm sorry.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.740
Are you all right?

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:31.940
Hang in there.

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.020
Pan-man.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:40.740
All I have to do is tell Ahri.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:45.420
Thanks to you, I was able to do a really great job.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.260
Thank you.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:51.810
Pan-man.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.490
Let's hurry up and go to Jamonji.

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:54.450
Yeah.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:55.380
Oh, Pan-man.

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:56.160
Thank you.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.630
Just a little bit of patience, okay?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:12.400
Then, Uncle Moji!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:35.860
What? Me?

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:42.580
It's a very good day, Hono-kun.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:44.150
It's warm and gentle.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:45.720
I feel relieved.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.240
That's good, that's good.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.260
Oh, right. I almost forgot about the presents from Anpanman and the others.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.140
Thank you, Sara-san.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.620
Hey, why are there only two of them?

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.150
Now, what should I do?

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.710
D-Dokin-chan is cold.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.230
You're not going to help me at all, are you?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.010
I didn't mean to do that.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:12.450
It's cold.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:14.410
Huh?

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.670
What is it?

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.390
See you next year, right, Do-Hin-Chan?

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:32.910
Huh?

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:45.280
Even though it's small...

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:04.840
Ugh!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.950
Not that many fish!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.120
Thank you.
